<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>五行理论 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 25 Jan 2026 09:18:45 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%A1%8C%E7%90%86%E8%AE%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>肺金篇第二十四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-24/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Dec 2025 15:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-24/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，深入辨析了肺（金）与脾胃（土）、肝（木）、肾（水）以及火之间的复杂生克制化关系，打破了常规五行生克的简单逻辑，提出了“微火生金”、“金水互生”、“顽金”等深刻的医学理论。</description></item><item><title>顺逆探原篇第二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-02/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 12:11:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-02/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>本文通过岐伯与伯高的问答，深刻阐释了道家“颠倒之术”的核心在于理解五行生克中的“顺逆”之理：即顺行相生却暗藏相克（害生于恩），逆行相克反得生机（仁生于义）。修行者欲在“逆”中求长生，须通过绝欲、守神、练气、保精等功夫，并领悟“心死则身生”的奥秘，最终达到“顺而不顺，逆而不逆”的至高境界。</description></item><item><title>刺法论篇第七十二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE72%E5%88%BA%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE72%E5%88%BA%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>探讨了人体内五行气机的升降变化及其对健康的影响，强调通过特定的针灸疗法来调整五脏气机的升降平衡，以预防和治疗因气机不顺导致的疾病。文章详细描述了各个脏腑在不同年运变化下的升降规律，并通过针灸调理来疏通气机、恢复气血平衡，防止疾病的发生。</description></item></channel></rss>